---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Rank Labs — GEO, ASO & SEO Platform" description="Rank Labs is an Orlando, Florida SEO, GEO and ASO platform built by Josiah and Palloma: weekly audits, AI readiness scores and full-site management.">

<section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-sm text-cyan-300 font-mono mb-4">OUR STORY</div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">About <span class="gradient-text">Rank Labs</span></h1>

    <!-- Josiah -->
    <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
      <img src="/josiah.jpeg" alt="Josiah — Co-founder of Rank Labs" class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-xl object-cover shrink-0" />
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Josiah</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-cyan-300 mb-3">Co-founder & Platform Engineer</p>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Josiah is a Lead SRE Engineer at Disney, where he designs and builds the platforms
            that power Disney's AI integrations at scale.
          </p>
          <p>
            He built Rank Labs' entire infrastructure — from the AI agent pipeline to the Kubernetes
            cluster, automated deployment system, and SEO crawling engine. His platform engineering
            background ensures every customer site runs on battle-tested infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Palloma -->
    <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
      <img src="/palloma.jpeg" alt="Palloma — Co-founder of Rank Labs" class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-xl object-cover shrink-0" />
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Palloma</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-cyan-300 mb-3">Co-founder & Marketing Strategist</p>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Palloma runs <strong class="text-white">One Take Wonder Marketing</strong> — a marketing
            and media placement company that helps businesses grow. For years, she hired outside
            agencies to handle SEO for her clients. The results? Spotty at best. Inconsistent
            deliverables, vague reports, and pricing that never matched the output.
          </p>
          <p>
            Her marketing expertise defined what SEO success actually looks like. She designed
            the formula — every check, every metric, every report section is based on what real
            businesses need to grow. She reviews every product decision through the lens of the
            business owner, not the engineer.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Story -->
    <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">How It Started</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          They built Rank Labs together. Palloma's marketing expertise defined what SEO success
          actually looks like. Josiah's platform engineering experience made it automated,
          consistent, and AI-driven. The result: a formula that covers everything SEO demands —
          and puts real updates in the hands of the customer, every single week.
        </p>
        <p>
          The two halves need each other. A marketer with no engineering behind her can only recommend work and hope
          someone carries it out. An engineer with no marketing background can build a very fast crawler that checks
          the wrong things. Rank Labs exists because Palloma decided what is worth measuring, and Josiah built the
          system that measures it the same way every time, on every site, without anyone having to remember to do it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Formula</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8">
        Every site that enters the Rank Labs system goes through the same proven formula:
        crawl → analyze → optimize → create → repeat. The system handles the heavy lifting at every
        stage — crawling thousands of pages, identifying gaps, drafting content, and tracking
        rankings. That same loop now extends to being agent-ready (ASO) — publishing the
        machine-readable hours, prices and booking path that get you chosen by AI, not just cited.
        <a href="/services" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">See our full service <span class="whitespace-nowrap">breakdown&nbsp;→</span></a>
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">What the Platform Does, End to End</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Here is what each step of the loop means in practice.
      </p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-3 text-muted mb-4">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Crawl.</strong> Every week the platform crawls every page of your site and runs
          100+ checks: title tags, meta descriptions, H1 structure, canonical URLs, Open Graph tags, schema markup,
          page speed, mobile friendliness, broken links and image alt text.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Analyze.</strong> The results become a report you can read without a
          dictionary: a score, a grade, the findings and a prioritized fix list. Alongside it sit Google organic and Maps
          rankings for 25 keywords, a backlink summary and a three-competitor comparison.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Optimize.</strong> With Full Management, Rank Labs makes the fixes on your
          behalf, re-crawls, re-audits and sends an updated report. With the Rank Labs Visibility Report, you or your
          team make the fixes, and Rank Labs does not change your site.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Create.</strong> Full Management includes researched, written blog content on a
          weekly basis, which you approve before it is published.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">Repeat.</strong> The next week starts with a fresh crawl, so you can see
          whether last week's work did what it was supposed to. A separate monthly report compares your results with the month before.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8">
        Each report also includes an AI readiness score for ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude and Perplexity, built from schema,
        direct-answer structure, AI-crawler access and freshness. It measures how ready your site is, not what those
        engines say about you. Our <a href="/services" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">services page</a>
        explains how SEO, GEO and ASO fit together.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">How Weekly Differs from an Agency Retainer</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Rank Labs is built around continuous execution, not occasional recommendations. The audit runs every week,
        and the report lands in your inbox with the findings and a fix list. On Full Management you reply to the
        report email with what you want addressed, and an approved request is applied, re-crawled and re-audited.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8">
        The plans are written in plain terms. The <a href="/pricing" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Rank Labs Visibility Report</a> is $499/month,
        report-only and month-to-month. Full Management is $2,500/month, and a 6-month contract gets the first
        month free and the $1,000 migration fee waived.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Who Rank Labs Is For</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Rank Labs is for business owners who want to be found on Google and in AI assistants' answers, and who are tired
        of paying for work they cannot see.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted mb-8">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">You want the data and will make the fixes yourself.</strong> Start with the
          Rank Labs Visibility Report.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">You want it done for you.</strong> Full Management covers the fixes, weekly
          content and hosting, with your approval on what gets published.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white">You are not sure where you stand.</strong> Request a free AI visibility audit
          through our <a href="/contact?intent=free-audit" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">contact page</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Why a Lab?</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Agencies rely on manual processes. Manual processes are slow, inconsistent, and expensive.
        A lab runs experiments at scale. Our platform runs the equivalent of a full SEO team's weekly
        output — every single day. Get the <a href="/pricing" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Rank Labs Visibility Report</a> for $499/month, or let us do the work with Full Management at $2,500/month.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted mb-8">
        You still get human oversight and final approval on everything. The platform does the heavy lifting.
        You make the calls. That's the formula. <a href="/faq" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">Read our FAQ →</a>
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Based in Orlando, Florida</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">
        Rank Labs is based in Orlando, Florida, and proudly operates from the Sunshine State. We serve businesses across the
        United States, from local shops to national brands.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted">
        The best way to start is to call <a href="tel:+14077438964" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">(407) 743-8964</a>
        or <a href="/contact" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">send us a message</a>, and a real person will read it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
